  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 41,
      "at": [
        -2,
        -18
      ],
      "text": "Run (F5) and click SW1: each press is a rising edge on CLK and the 4-bit counter adds one.\nThe LEDs show the count in binary (Q3 Q2 Q1 Q0, left to right). Turn on Bounce in SW1's\nproperties and see a single press count several times: why real buttons need debouncing."
    }
  ]
